    "body": "I'm unclear on the intended normative status of this text. Is this a \"should\" not have observable effects, or a \"must\"?\r\n\r\nIf it's a \"must\", then I think we're just dealing with how specs normally work. So I'd say something like\r\n\r\n> User agents might perform .... However, these cannot have any observable effects.\r\n\r\nIf it's a \"should\", then it'd be good to have some examples of what observable effects user agents might perform to violate the \"should\".",
